senses.gloss:
परि-√ पच् P. -पचति, to bring to maturity, Divyāv. :
Pass. -पच्यते, to be cooked, Pañc.;
to be burnt (in hell), Hariv.;
to become ripe, (fig.) have results or consequences, Hariv.; Var.;
 approach one's end or issue, MBh. :
Caus. -पाचयति, to cook, roast, Suśr.;
to cause to ripen, bring to maturity or perfection, Kāraṇḍ.

परि-√ पत् P. -पतति (3. pl. pf. -पेतुर्), to fly or run about, wheel or whirl round, rush to and fro, move hither and thither, RV. &c. &c.;
to leap down from (abl.), MBh.;
to throw one's self upon, attack (with loc.), ib.; Kāv. :
Caus. -पातयति, to cause to fall down, shoot down or off, MBh.;
to throw into (loc.), Mṛcch.;
to destroy, Divyāv.

परि-√ पश् P. -पश्यति, to look over, survey, RV.; AV.;
to perceive, behold, see, observe, RV.; TS.; Br.; Up.;
to fix the mind or thoughts upon (acc.), MBh.;
to learn, know, recognise as (2 acc.), MuṇḍUp.; MBh.; BhP.

परि-√ पीड् P. -पीडयति, to press all round, press together, squeeze, Kāv.; Suśr.;
to torment, harass, vex, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
 (in augury) to cover, cover up, Var.

परि-√ पॄ Pass. -पूर्यते, to fill (intrans.), become completely full, Rājat. :
Caus. -पूरयति, to fill (trans.), make full, cover or occupy completely, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to fulfil, accomplish, go through, Kāraṇḍ.

परि-√ प्लु Ā. -प्लवते (ind.p. -प्लुत्य, MBh.; -प्लूय, Pāṇ. vi, 4, 58),
to swim or float or hover about or through, Br. &c. &c.;
to revolve, move in a circle, ŚBr.;
to move restlessly, go astray, Br.;
to hasten forward or near, MBh. :
Caus. -प्लावयति (ind.p. -प्लाव्य), to bathe, water, MBh.
